<title>POLAND: UNIBUD JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>UNIBUD JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.51 vs   0.68</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.84 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.97 vs   0.66</p>
<p> Sales		    8.95 vs   5.86</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.97 vs   1.53</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.40 vs   2.70</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.74 vs   2.92</p>
<p> Sales		   43.23 vs  36.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish builder is Unibud SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
